            "characters": "💳 CHECKOUT\n\nStep 1: Review & Confirm\n• Booking summary\n• Price breakdown\n\nStep 2: Traveler Details\n• Personal information\n• Passport details\n\nStep 3: Payment\n• Stripe integration\n• Payment processing\n• Security indicators",
